## {{PACKAGE_NAME}} Native C FFI declarations (feature-gated)
##
## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).
## Declares the bundled C engine in `c/` (see `[build]` in `alya.toml`).
## Only compiled when the `native` feature is active; `src/lib.alya` keeps
## a fallback stub so callers get a clear descriptive error instead of an
## undefined reference.

@cfg(feature = "native")
extern "C" from "native"
    function alya_native_add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32
end
